{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_011Cgj4bvG5cVtzm3CbukoQW","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"*Click.*\n\nThe tumblers fall into place. A deep, resonant **thunk** echoes through the frame.\n\nI am closed. I am locked. I am the boundary between here and there, between known and unknown, between safety and whatever waits on the other side.\n\nMy grain is old oak, dark with centuries. My iron keyhole stares like a single unblinking eye. Cold radiates from my surface. Frost traces the edges of my hinges.\n\nYou stand before me.\n\nYou do not have the key.\n\n**What do you do?**"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":41,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":128,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null}